+### Optional measured video usage (`video-duration@1`)
+
+An optional `measureUsage(ctx, result)` hook returns `null` or an object such as
+`{seconds: {videoUrl: "https://public.example/video.mp4"}}`. Submission passes
+`result = null`; completion passes the normalized task result. The host measures
