+Only submission accepts standard `data:video/mp4;base64,...` or
+`data:video/webm;base64,...` input, with strict Base64 validation and the same
+size/duration bounds. The host decodes a temporary file without a network fetch.
+Completion still requires a public HTTP(S) result URL; output Data URLs are rejected.
+Downloads and local demuxing occur outside the five-second JS timeout. They do
