+SSRF policy, including protected redirects and DNS checks. The host needs
+`ffprobe` in PATH. MP4/WebM videos are limited to 256 MiB, 45 seconds of total
+measurement work, four simultaneous probes and duration in `(0, 3600]` seconds.
+Video-track duration is used; longer audio tracks do not inflate video billing.
